#: crates/tsuba-gui/qml/AboutPage.qml:21 crates/tsuba-gui/qml/HomePage.qml:451
msgid ""
"Tsuba is an independent open-source project, not affiliated with or endorsed "
"by Razer Inc. Razer, Synapse, Chroma, HyperShift, BlackWidow and Basilisk "
"are trademarks of Razer Inc., named here only to identify compatible "
"hardware."
