#: crates/tsuba-gui/qml/Main.qml:204
msgid ""
"OpenRazer's kernel driver is loaded. It can take devices away from Tsuba or "
"fight over lighting."
msgstr ""
"OpenRazer のカーネルドライバーが読み込まれています。デバイスを Tsuba から奪っ"
"たり、ライティングを競合させたりすることがあります。"

#: crates/tsuba-gui/qml/Main.qml:204
msgid ""
"Run tsuba-handover in a terminal to switch it off. Undo with tsuba-handover-"
"restore."
msgstr ""
"端末で tsuba-handover を実行すると無効にできます。元に戻すには tsuba-"
"handover-restore を実行します。"

#: crates/tsuba-gui/qml/Main.qml:206
msgid ""
"%1 is running. It and Tsuba both control your lighting, so colours may "
